#: ../../tools/fourdn_tools.rst:143 791a0bc4769d4ddb9f722af7bcaa093a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search 4DN Data Portal for Hi-C chromatin conformation "
"files and experiments. Access 350+ uniformly processed Hi-C contact files"
" from multiple technologies (in situ Hi-C, Capture Hi-C, Micro-C XL). "
"Search by assay type, cell type, or keywords. Returns file metadata with "
"download URLs. Note: Downloads require free 4DN account (create at "
"data.4dnucleome.org). Use for: finding Hi-C datasets, discovering 3D "
"genome data, accessing TAD (Topologically Associating Domain) boundaries,"
" A/B compartments, chromatin loop calls."
msgstr ""

